WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.090
- Eric's outfits, season one, season two

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:06.582
led an emotional journal through fashion.

00:00:06.582 --> 00:00:10.082
(upbeat percussive music)

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:15.090
I am gonna take you through three outfits

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:17.860
that I feel best describe Eric's journey

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:18.890
throughout season one.

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:20.980
So this shirt, we see, it's the shirt

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.010
that he's wearing the first
time he meets Maeve Wiley.

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:25.770
And I think at this point,
Eric is like very much trying

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:27.240
to impress the world.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.720
He's trying a little bit too hard.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.330
I mean, he actually ends
up coming into school

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:31.560
with his buttons done up wrong

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:34.828
and tries to make up like some
new craze called norm-core,

00:00:34.828 --> 00:00:36.450
which is not a thing.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:37.563
It's a new look.

00:00:37.563 --> 00:00:38.940
It's like norm-core.

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:42.210
This outfit we see when
Eric is kinda going

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:45.560
through a tough time and he's
trying to rebuild himself.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.170
This is sad Eric. (laughs)

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:48.780
After the journey that he's gone on.

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:50.080
But we see him emerge.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:52.390
And he goes back to church
and gets accepted back

00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:54.020
into church, into the community.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:56.860
And bam, comes through with this,

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:59.270
with the Kentai, the Kentai suit, fitted.

00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:01.880
I just loved it because I am Rwandan,

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:03.260
so I have African heritage.

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:06.800
Felt nice the day of filming
to kind of just stand there

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:09.260
on the Netflix set and
stand there unashamedly.

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:11.970
I would say this is like
the piece de resistance.

00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:15.440
Snatched at the waist, gave
enough room for the cakes.

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:18.510
From norm-core all the way
to the African butterfly,

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:21.059
this is the emotional
journey of Eric season one.

00:01:21.059 --> 00:01:23.580
(groovy music)

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:25.640
Eric is a bit of a ho this season.

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:27.520
He's got a couple men that
he's deciding between.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.353
Yeah, one of them

00:01:28.353 --> 00:01:31.623
is a French sophisticated
something-something.

00:01:31.623 --> 00:01:33.280
So Eric gets the bright idea to come in

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:34.760
with a scarf. (laughs)

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.930
So he's got this little
scarf, and this is the scarf

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:38.290
he uses to find his man.

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:40.510
You wanna find a man, get a nice scarf.

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:43.720
He goes camping with Remi and Otis.

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:45.770
This is what he wears to a campsite.

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:47.813
So obviously, Eric has
never been camping before.

00:01:47.813 --> 00:01:50.500
And he turns it into a fashion parade.

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:53.860
And with these and some
espadrilles, it gets very wet.

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:58.113
Now, this suit is what
he wears to Otis's party.

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:02.970
And in season two, we see Eric,

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:04.640
he comes a lot more into himself.

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:06.710
He's being a lot more bold
with his fashion choices,

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:07.720
as we can tell.

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:10.800
I think Rahim's had a bit of
a like, cool influence on him.

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:12.505
This is an extension of the leopard print

00:02:12.505 --> 00:02:14.110
that we see in season one.

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:15.688
And obviously, it's
just a lot more full-on

00:02:15.688 --> 00:02:18.300
'cause Eric is a lot
more full-on this year.

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:22.042
Who doesn't want a fur,
leopard print track suit?

00:02:22.042 --> 00:02:24.442
(laughs) It's a leopard
track suit, enough said.

